    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i can't really get an appointment for a few days and i feel like i can't even breathe through my nose. isn't sudafed just a standard decongestant? i dont think it's gonna do anything to my antipsychotics, it's just for my nose. is there any specific reason why it would be bad?",
